WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.713 --> 00:00:03.537
- Hey, Teresa, would you
like to grab a bite to eat?

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.147
- Yeah, can my boyfriend, Roger, come?

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.048
- Hi, Tony, I think I love you.

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:14.317
- I love you too, as a friend.

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:16.775
- Has this ever happened to you?

00:00:16.775 --> 00:00:20.676
Hi, we're Jackson, Jackson, and Jackson,

00:00:20.676 --> 00:00:24.862
and together we make Jackson,
Jackson, and Jackson.

00:00:24.862 --> 00:00:27.117
And we're here to help you get

00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:29.278
out of the friend zone today.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.404
- Finally.

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:32.785
- It's a miracle.

00:00:32.785 --> 00:00:35.773
- With just six easy payments of $12.99...

00:00:35.773 --> 00:00:38.555
- We can help you get
out of the friend zone...

00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:40.120
- With 10 simple steps.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.050
- Wow, what a reasonable price.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.756
- And seems super simple.

00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:44.813
- It is.

00:00:44.813 --> 00:00:46.337
- We'll give you simple steps,

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:48.368
like step one, climb a ladder

00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:50.725
to symbolically climb
out of the friend zone.

00:00:50.725 --> 00:00:52.249
Don't believe us that it works,

00:00:52.249 --> 00:00:54.179
just ask this guy.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.333
- After I climbed out of the friend zone,

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.194
I was finally ready to be
the man that Pamela wanted.

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:01.799
- That's not enough for you,

00:01:01.799 --> 00:01:03.809
then try step four,

00:01:03.809 --> 00:01:06.694
buy your future lover flowers every day

00:01:06.694 --> 00:01:09.012
until they cave in and love you back.

00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:12.017
- I bought Marie flowers for 72 days

00:01:12.017 --> 00:01:13.523
until she finally came around.

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:16.528
- Or maybe try step six,

00:01:16.528 --> 00:01:18.986
call your future lover's parents

00:01:18.986 --> 00:01:22.023
and convince them you are the one.

00:01:23.639 --> 00:01:25.610
- After I called Mr. and Mrs. Peterson,

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:28.373
they helped me land my dream boat.

00:01:28.373 --> 00:01:30.648
- So, none of those steps worked for you?

00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:32.781
Well, here's the best step of them all,

00:01:32.781 --> 00:01:35.261
step seven, never say never.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.901
- Keep pushing on even
if she turns you down.

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:39.750
- Still need proof?

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.798
No worries, take it from Cindy.

00:01:42.798 --> 00:01:44.221
She tried these steps

00:01:44.221 --> 00:01:46.263
and now she's super thrilled.

00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:49.056
- Actually no, I didn't
follow those steps.

00:01:49.056 --> 00:01:50.416
See, I realized a long time ago

00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:51.554
that if somebody doesn't love you,

00:01:51.554 --> 00:01:52.631
that's just the way it is.

00:01:52.631 --> 00:01:54.420
You're just gonna have to accept it.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.187
I mean, if they don't have
mutual feelings about you,

00:01:56.187 --> 00:01:58.767
well, it's OK.

00:01:58.767 --> 00:02:00.555
There's nothing wrong with friendship.

00:02:00.555 --> 00:02:02.830
- (laughs) What?

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:05.045
Some people are just crazy.

00:02:05.045 --> 00:02:07.320
- The friend zone is definitely a thing,

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.648
and you should pay us money
to help you get out of it.

00:02:11.648 --> 00:02:16.648
- For just seven easy payments of $24.99

00:02:16.808 --> 00:02:20.812
we can help you get out
of the friend zone today.

00:02:20.812 --> 00:02:21.908
- 'Cause we're Jackson...

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:22.742
- Jackson...

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.775
- And Jackson.

00:02:23.775 --> 00:02:26.845
("Later Days")

00:02:26.845 --> 00:02:28.877
- This plan is full proof.

00:02:28.877 --> 00:02:31.640
- I married my best
friend, who's also my wife.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:34.403
- [Man in Suit] I'm not a scam
artist, I'm the love doctor.

00:02:34.403 --> 00:02:36.577
- Our current president
has used this system

00:02:36.577 --> 00:02:38.012
to get his way.

00:02:38.751 --> 00:02:40.925
- I'm more confident than ever.

00:02:40.925 --> 00:02:43.338
- Can't wait to see all the new couples.

